---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ActionLabel from '../../components/ActionLabel.astro';
import { renewalQuestions } from '../../data/softwareRenewal';
import '../../styles/services.css';
import '../../styles/editorial-pages.css';
import '../../styles/resource-page.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Before You Renew: Free Software Checklist | Cloud & Capital" description="Review one software subscription before it renews. Eight questions, separate renewal and notice dates, and a free two-page PDF you can type in or print. No signup.">
  <main id="main-content" class="offer-page editorial-page resource-page">
    <section class="offer-shell editorial-hero">
      <div>
        <a class="resource-back" href="/insights#resources">← Free resources</a>
        <p class="offer-eyebrow">Software spending · A free worksheet</p>
        <h1><span class="renewal-title-line">Before you renew</span> <em>that software.</em></h1>
        <p class="editorial-lede">Your software has a renewal date. It deserves a little performance review.</p>
        <p>For business owners and teams deciding whether to keep or change a subscription. Pick one tool. Bring the bill, the plan terms and a recent example of how it is used.</p>
        <div class="offer-actions">
          <a class="offer-button" href="/downloads/before-you-renew-that-software.pdf" download><ActionLabel label="Get the free worksheet" /></a>
          <a class="quiet-link" href="#questions"><ActionLabel label="Read the questions" /></a>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note">Two pages. Type in a PDF reader or print it. Save a copy to keep your answers. No signup required.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="renewal-preview">
        <img src="/images/software-renewal-worksheet-preview.jpg" alt="First page of the actual worksheet, with separate fields for renewal date, last day to give notice and next charge date" width="1152" height="1491" decoding="async" />
        <figcaption>The first page of the worksheet. Eight questions across two pages.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <aside class="offer-shell renewal-deadline-note" aria-labelledby="notice-title">
      <p class="offer-eyebrow">The date worth finding first</p>
      <h2 id="notice-title">When do you have to give notice?</h2>
      <p>The last day to cancel or change a plan can be earlier than its renewal date. The next payment can be a different date too. Check the provider’s terms and write down all three. If something is unconfirmed, mark it for a follow-up.</p>
    </aside>

    <section id="questions" class="offer-shell editorial-section" aria-labelledby="questions-title">
      <p class="offer-eyebrow">One subscription at a time</p>
      <h2 id="questions-title">Eight questions. A clearer next step.</h2>
      <ol class="question-grid">{renewalQuestions.map(q => <li><h3>{q.title}</h3><p>{q.detail}</p></li>)}</ol>
    </section>

    <section class="offer-shell renewal-next" aria-labelledby="next-title">
      <p class="offer-eyebrow">Then make the call</p>
      <h2 id="next-title">Keeping it is a decision too.</h2>
      <p>Write down what makes sense, who will act and when. You might keep the tool, adjust the plan, compare alternatives or check one missing detail.</p>
      <div class="renewal-next-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Give the dates a home.</h3>
          <p>Keep the charge, renewal date and notice deadline together in the free Software Renewal Tracker. See the payments due each month and export calendar events for the dates you enter.</p>
          <a href="/tools/software-renewal-tracker" data-analytics-event="cta_click" data-analytics-destination="software_renewal_tracker" data-analytics-source="software_renewal_resource"><ActionLabel label="Open the renewal tracker" /></a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Want another set of eyes?</h3>
          <p>A Technology Cost Review gives us a place to work through your spending, terms and questions. Bring the worksheet along. We agree the scope and quote before work begins.</p>
          <a href="/services#technology-cost-review"><ActionLabel label="Explore a cost review" /></a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <a class="renewal-companion" href="/insights/is-this-software-worth-it"><ActionLabel label="Read the software spending guide" /></a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
